to hand: Basic costs one other skill and Expert two, costs { basic: 1, expert: 2 }; no other style is offered, which is the book''s except hand to hand other than those already noted. || EQUIPMENT: the blanket of healing, leaf or bark armor, throwing stick and one wand or staff are the held Millennium rows (printed 19-22, cited to Japan; newest printing wins, ruling 2026-10-04); the staff offer drops the Staff of the Serpent, Prosperity and Life as printed. A wooden staff is stored as a quarterstaff, matches or a lighter as a lighter, tinted goggles or sunglasses as tinted goggles. Not stored: a wooden knife (1D4 S.D.C.) and 1D4+1 non-magical throwing sticks (1D6 S.D.C., range 200 ft), which have no rows; the high-level kit (a magic staff, up to four wands, two to four throwing sticks and blankets, a magic javelin); traditional garb."
